    {
      "blockId": "tour:itinerary_text:b04d5d61d358e759",
      "field": "itinerary.text",
      "sourceTextSha256": "c3c89af780655673a88f90997159e95e8ac7f8dcfbb7b47d0f9165b8b2172d07",
      "text": "After breakfast you will enjoy a morning jaguar safari. Then transfer  to the plane station  for your flight to Bonito.\n\nBonito is one of the most popular ecotourism destinations in Brazil. In Portuguese, the word Bonito means beautiful, too modest to describe the totality of the beauty of this exotic area.\n\nThe natural beauties in Bonito include caverns with deep azure lakes inside, incredibly clear rivers that work as natural aquariums, hundreds of waterfalls and much more. Bonito is a unique place where you will be able to see the beautiful composition that stalactites and stalagmites make on the ceiling of the caves, as well as down the water of the big lakes formed inside them. ",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "word_exact",
